# Neither Dockerfile ever COPYs the whole build context — each names exact paths — but the
# context is still assembled and sent to the daemon in full, so excluding these keeps that step
# fast and (for .data/) working at all: Postgres's own data directory contains files the daemon
# cannot stat with the permissions they were created under.
.data/
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
dist
**/dist
